OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with sunny spells
OL,6,Fat first, and perhaps a few showers.
OL,7,FCloud thickening into the afternoon,
OL,8,Fwith outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,9,Feastward across all parts, although
OL,10,Fsome sheltered eastern parts should
OL,11,Fremain drier. Becoming windy.
OL,12,FTemperatures near average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,15,Flight rain and drizzle at times,
OL,16,Fmainly on western hills. A blustery
OL,17,Fnight, especially on western hills.
OL,18,FStaying mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
