OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FEarly cloud and outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will gradually clear to the
OL,7,Fsouth. Becoming drier and brighter
OL,8,Finto the afternoon. Chance of a few
OL,9,Fshowers. Blustery winds. Warmer and
OL,10,Fmore humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDrier
OL,13,Fand brighter with variable cloud
OL,14,FSunday. Cloudier on Monday with a
OL,15,Flittle rain, brightest in the east.
OL,16,FRain possibly moving southeast
OL,17,FTuesday. Temperatures near normal,
OL,18,Fbecoming warmer Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
